			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"常九爷"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 221160701,
					"content": "我上次去城里的时候，碰巧看见了一个人和一个似乎是在占卜的姑娘啰嗦个不停，但我那时候没有详细听下去…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221160702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "常九爷"
				},
				{
					"id": 221160702,
					"content": "后来我打听到，这两个人一个叫志华，一个叫绮命，你去帮我再打听打听，如果有什么好故事，就快点拿回来给我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "常九爷"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2211608,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_NONE",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_QUEST_VAR_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1",
							"2",
							"22116"
						]
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"常九爷"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 221160801,
					"content": "这么一说，你见过一个叫思思的姑娘吗？她似乎一直在等着一个叫做潮汐的水手。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221160802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "常九爷"
				},
				{
					"id": 221160802,
					"content": "在我印象中，她好像隔段时间就要去等一次…这思思和潮汐之间，到底有什么故事呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221160803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "常九爷"
				},
				{
					"id": 221160803,
